  - nodeId: number_letter
    lines:
    - speakerId: clerk
      language: 1
      text: A letter from Declan O'Sullivan? He sends me a new one every month. Grand, here's your number.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Siedem cyfr i litera. \u017Badna liczba jeszcze mnie tak nie wzruszy\u0142a."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - letter
    - month
    - here's
    - your
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: number_loop_breaks
  - nodeId: number_fake
    lines:
    - speakerId: clerk
      language: 1
      text: An electricity bill... dated next month? Hm. Well. It has your name on it. Here's your number.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Rachunek z dat\u0105 z przysz\u0142ego miesi\u0105ca. Go\u015B\u0107 Marka ma fantazj\u0119. Urz\u0119dniczka ma lito\u015B\u0107. Albo kolejk\u0119 do trzysetki."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - electricity
    - month
    - here's
    - your
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch1_clerk_noticed
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: number_loop_breaks
  - nodeId: number_loop_breaks
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Z numerem PPS bank otwiera konto w dziesi\u0119\u0107 minut. Z kontem pani Byrne wzdycha i wpisuje Kub\u0119 do umowy. P\u0119tla p\u0119ka."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: number_mum
  - nodeId: number_mum
    lines:
    - speakerId: mum
      language: 0
      text: "Kubu\u015B? Wys\u0142a\u0142am paczk\u0119. S\u0142oik bigosu, s\u0142oik og\xF3rk\xF3w i skarpetki. Jesz co\u015B ciep\u0142ego?"
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Bigos w kuchni na dziewi\u0119\u0107 os\xF3b. Znika w siedem minut. M\xF3j rekord zmywaka to wci\u0105\u017C d\u0142u\u017Cej."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 15
      homesickness: -10
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: number_end
  - nodeId: number_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Pierwszy tydzie\u0144 w Dublinie: oszukany, bez \u0142\xF3\u017Cka, za to z numerem PPS i s\u0142oikiem bigosu. Brudne talerze. Czyste marzenia."
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Koniec Rozdzia\u0142u 1: Przyjazd."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
